{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/722","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/722/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/722/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/722/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/722","id":121204981,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjEyMDQ5ODE=","number":722,"title":"starargs result in no-value-for-parameter","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":297274515,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcyNzQ1MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/Bug%20:beetle:","name":"Bug :beetle:","color":"ea9896","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2015-12-05T11:03:40Z","updated_at":"2016-01-09T16:32:30Z","closed_at":"2016-01-09T16:32:30Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Originally reported by: **Alexey Kotlyarov (BitBucket: [koterpillar](http://bitbucket.org/koterpillar), GitHub: @koterpillar?)**\n\n---\n\nThe following code:\n\n``` python\ndef foo(one, two, three):\n    pass\n\n\ndef bar(*args):\n    foo(*args)\n```\n\nProduces:\n\n```\nE:  6, 4: No value for argument 'one' in function call (no-value-for-parameter)\nE:  6, 4: No value for argument 'two' in function call (no-value-for-parameter)\nE:  6, 4: No value for argument 'three' in function call (no-value-for-parameter)\n```\n\nIf `**kwargs` are added to the signature and `foo` call in `bar`, the warning disappears. The following also hides the warning:\n\n``` python\ndef bar(*args):\n    foo(*args, **{})\n```\n\nTherefore calling without `kwargs` should also work IMO.\n\n---\n- Bitbucket: https://bitbucket.org/logilab/pylint/issue/722\n","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fals